### Real test requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Start the server first: uvicorn app.main:app --reload
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/orchestrator

### Service and index status
GET {{base}}/health

### Available MCP servers
GET {{base}}/mcps

### Fictitious users and their connected MCP servers
GET {{base}}/users

### 1. Billing -> stripe first, quickbooks close behind (user 3 is connected to everything)
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "list the unpaid invoices", "user_id": 3}

### 1b. The example of the LinkedIn post: no "CRM" in the question, still routed to hubspot
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "who did I not call back this week?", "user_id": 3}

### 1c. Same question for user 1, who has no CRM connected -> mcp_not_connected, suggests hubspot
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "who did I not call back this week?", "user_id": 1}

### 2. Meeting -> google_calendar or zoom (both are valid; the top tool is not always create_*)
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "schedule a meeting with Sophie on Thursday at 2pm", "user_id": 3}

### 3. Code -> github
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "merge PR 42 in the frontend repo", "user_id": 3}

### 4. Ticket -> jira
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "create a Jira ticket to redesign the home page", "user_id": 3}

### 5. Weather -> openweather
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "what's the weather like in Lyon?", "user_id": 3}

### 6. MCP not connected: user 4 has nothing -> mcp_not_connected, suggests slack
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "send a Slack message to the team about the meeting", "user_id": 4}

### 7. Drive in error for user 5: "the Drive" is named -> mcp_not_connected, suggests google_drive
###    (before explicit mentions, a Google Sheets tool was proposed as a false lead)
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "share the report.pdf file from the Drive with Paul", "user_id": 5}

### 7b. Explicit mention: "Notion" restricts routing to Notion (see mentioned_mcps in the response)
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "add a row to my Notion reading list for the book Dune", "user_id": 3}

### 7c. Product convention: "ticket PROJ-12" designates Jira, "#general" designates Slack
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "move ticket PROJ-12 to done", "user_id": 3}

### 8. Knowledge question -> direct_answer
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "what is a pull request?", "user_id": 3}

### 9. Out of domain -> direct_answer expected
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "write me a poem about autumn", "user_id": 3}

### 10. Explicit scope (no user_id): only gmail and notion allowed
POST {{base}}/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "email paul@example.com to confirm the appointment", "allowed_mcps": ["gmail", "notion"], "top_k": 3}

### 11. Raw scores without thresholds (to understand a decision): semantic and keyword parts per tool
POST {{base}}/route/explain
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "find a one-hour slot with Marc and Lea", "user_id": 3}

### 12. Re-index after editing app/data/mock_data.json
POST {{base}}/index/rebuild
